		<ul id="e00199">
			<li>
				<p outputclass="across">Actual charger image and charging method may vary in accordance with the charger manufacturer.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>For your safety, your vehicle may stop charging if the external charger is outdated or defective. Try charging the vehicle using a different charger that works properly.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p outputclass="across">A maximum diagnosis time of 3 minutes may be added to check the battery condition during the battery charging process.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p outputclass="across">Charger removal time may vary by charging service provider. Instrument cluster indicator or message may differ by charger type. Reconnection may be required depending on the charging status.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p importance="default">Depending on your region, ICCB cable for trickle charge may not be provided in your vehicle.</p>
